209959},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/SeachAndSort","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/SeachAndSort","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Given a list of numbers by the user, this program will find the element the user is searching for.","topics":[],"score":218799,"global_rank":209960},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/shapes","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/shapes","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have multiple shapes. Each shape does something different depending on what it is.","topics":[],"score":218799,"global_rank":209961},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/quilts","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/quilts","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have a business that sells quilts of the same pattern, but different sizes depending on the customers needs. A customer is able to request a quilt with this pattern as big as they want.","topics":[],"score":218799,"global_rank":209962},{"name":"fabricekalvanda/diceGame","owner":"fabricekalvanda","html_url":"https://github.com/fabricekalvanda/diceGame","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"I have 2 die, 6 sided each I start the game and print the intro  \u201cHey! Welcome to Tina\u2019s Dice Game.\u201d \u201cLet\u2019s start!\u201d The computer randomly generates what side of the die is chosen (for each die) I then add both of the random numbers together  I then print  Dice 1 = (the random number I got)  Dice 2 = (the random number I got) Depending on what number I get, something different is printed to the screen If I get an even number  I print \u201cI got (value of dice 1) and (value of dice 2)!\u201d  I print \u201cEvens are better than odds!\u201d If I get an odd number I print \u201cI got (value of dice 1) and (value of dice 2)!\u201d  I print \u201cOdds are still cool!\u201d At the end, I ask the user if they want to play again If the answer is \u201cYES\u201d  I \u201cthrow\u201d the die again and repeat the printing process If the answer is anything but YES (case-sensitive) I end the game and print the outro  \u201cThe number of times the dice was thrown is: (value of times dice is thrown)\u201d \u201cNice game!\u201d \u201cThanks for playing, Come play again soon!\u201d\u2028","topics":[],"score":218799,"global_rank":209963},{"name":"spconger/WCFServiceAssignment","owner":"spconger","html_url":"https://github.com/spconger/WCFServiceAssignment","stars":0,"forks":2,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"WCF Service Assignment for ITC 172","topics":[],"score":218795,"global_rank":210002},{"name":"ungood/puzzles","owner":"ungood","html_url":"https://github.com/ungood/puzzles","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"A home for various puzzles and fun problems to solve.","topics":[],"score":218792,"global_rank":210009},{"name":"dumax315/SpookyJam23","owner":"dumax315","html_url":"https://github.com/dumax315/SpookyJam23","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":218786,"global_rank":210052},{"name":"andouu/todolist-backend-benchmark","owner":"andouu","html_url":"https://github.com/andouu/todolist-backend-benchmark","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"C# backend benchmark for the UW DECA summer project.","topics":[],"score":218777,"global_rank":210131},{"name":"akkaneror/ARModeler","owner":"akkaneror","html_url":"https://github.com/akkaneror/ARModeler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":null,"topics":[],"score":218768,"global_rank":210245},{"name":"mortid0/gateway_test","owner":"mortid0","html_url":"https://github.com/mortid0/gateway_test","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C#","description":"Test getaway implementation with C#",